@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "诊所负责人" as A0
boundary "<u>:诊所负责人接口</u>" as B0
control "<u>:登记器械包使用</u>\n<u>与追溯控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:器械处理</u>" as Process
participant "<u>:器械包处理</u>" as PackCycle
participant "<u>:器械使用</u>" as InstrumentUse
participant "<u>:就诊</u>" as Visit
participant "<u>:差异跟进</u>" as FollowIssue
A0 -> B0 : 提交UC-31办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-31办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Process : 标记事后异常(异常及依据)
activate Process
Process -> PackCycle : 停止后续正常使用(涉及本轮包次)
activate PackCycle
PackCycle --> Process : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate PackCycle
Process --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Process
K -> Process : 提供受影响包次(已发放及已使用范围)
activate Process
Process -> PackCycle : 提供本轮追溯(已使用和已发放范围)
activate PackCycle
PackCycle -> InstrumentUse : 提供实际使用依据(原发放、使用或异常补录)
activate InstrumentUse
InstrumentUse --> PackCycle : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate InstrumentUse
PackCycle --> Process : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate PackCycle
Process --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Process
K -> Visit : 提供获准追查信息(受影响就诊)
activate Visit
Visit --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Visit
K -> FollowIssue : 登记异常追查(负责人意见、责任和期限)
activate FollowIssue
FollowIssue --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate FollowIssue
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
note over K,FollowIssue
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
